  "bodyText": "Ministers\n\nJaden Johnson\n\nChildren's Ministry Coordinator\n\nKendall Ellis\n\nCo-Pastor\n\nKendall Ellis is one of the Co-Pastors of First Baptist, alongside her husband Jonathan.\n\nCheryl Flaherty\n\nAdult Coordinator\n\nEd Brzak\n\nAt Large Coordinator\n\nSandi Brzak\n\nTreasurer\n\nCaroline Koby\n\nWorship / Children's Ministry Intern\n\nCaroline is an intern in the areas of Children and Worship Ministry.\n\nAndy Heimlich\n\nModerator\n\nJonathan Balmer\n\nJonathan is one of the Co-Pastors of First Baptist, alongside his wife Kendall Ellis.\n\nDana Davis\n\nOutreach Coordinator\n\nElla Mae Lemen\n\nWedding Coordinator\n\nElla Mae is a long-time member of First Baptist Church who also serves as our Wedding Coordinator.\n\nJoe Songer\n\nProperty Coordinator\n\nSally Butler\n\nMember Care Coordinator\n\nCynthia Smith\n\nWorship Arts Director\n\nCynthia leads our congregation in intentional times of worship.\n\nLoraine Garrett\n\nYouth Coordinator\n\nNina Oisten\n\nClerk\n\nMolly Flodder\n\nWorship Coordinator\n\n[Button] Read More -> https://www.fbcmuncie.org/team/jaden-johnson\n\n[Button] Read More -> https://www.fbcmuncie.org/team/kendall-ellis\n\n[Button] Read More -> https://www.fbcmuncie.org/team/cheryl-flaherty\n\n[Button] Read More -> https://www.fbcmuncie.org/team/ed-brzak\n\n[Button] Read More -> https://www.fbcmuncie.org/team/sandi-brzak\n\n[Button] Read More -> https://www.fbcmuncie.org/team/caroline-koby\n\n[Button] Read More -> https://www.fbcmuncie.org/team/andy-heimlich\n\n[Button] Read More -> https://www.fbcmuncie.org/team/jonathan-balmer\n\n[Button] Read More -> https://www.fbcmuncie.org/team/dana-davis\n\n[Button] Read More -> https://www.fbcmuncie.org/team/ella-mae-lemen\n\n[Button] Read More -> https://www.fbcmuncie.org/team/joe-songer\n\n[Button] Read More -> https://www.fbcmuncie.org/team/sally-butler\n\n[Button] Read More -> https://www.fbcmuncie.org/team/cynthia-smith\n\n[Button] Read More -> https://www.fbcmuncie.org/team/loraine-garrett\n\n[Button] Read More -> https://www.fbcmuncie.org/team/nina-oisten\n\n[Button] Read More -> https://www.fbcmuncie.org/team/molly-flodder",
